%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject:
    fileID: 0
  m_PrefabInstance:
    fileID: 0
  m_PrefabAsset:
    fileID: 0
  m_GameObject:
    fileID: 0
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script:
    fileID: 11500000
    guid: bd46540139c34d48bd88012dfc1a4510
    type: 3
  m_Name: KernelOnboardingTexts
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: ''
  tableId: kernel-onboarding-texts
  entries:
  - key: onboarding.speaker
    language: ko
    text: 현장지원과
  - key: onboarding.speaker
    language: en
    text: Field Support
  - key: terminal.dialogue.receiving
    language: ko
    text: 수신 중 · 안내가 끝나면 입력할 수 있습니다.
  - key: terminal.dialogue.receiving
    language: en
    text: Receiving · wait until the message finishes.
  - key: terminal.dialogue.command
    language: ko
    text: 안내 명령
  - key: terminal.dialogue.command
    language: en
    text: Requested command
  - key: terminal.dialogue.standby
    language: ko
    text: 작전망 연결 대기
  - key: terminal.dialogue.standby
    language: en
    text: Operations network standby
  - key: onboarding.welcome
    language: ko
    text: Kernel을 찾으셨군요.
  - key: onboarding.welcome
    language: en
    text: You found Kernel.
  - key: onboarding.connection
    language: ko
    text: 현장지원과입니다. 메일은 확인하셨겠지요. 먼저 작전망의 기본 사용법부터 확인하겠습니다.
  - key: onboarding.connection
    language: en
    text: Field Support here. You have read the mail. Let's check the basics of the operations network.
  - key: onboarding.listen
    language: ko
    text: '안내가 수신되는 동안에는 명령을 입력할 수 없습니다. 안내가 끝나면 다음 명령을 입력해 보십시오:

      {command}'
  - key: onboarding.listen
    language: en
    text: You cannot enter commands while a message is being received. When it finishes, enter {command}.
  - key: onboarding.permissions
    language: ko
    text: 잘하셨습니다. 권한 목록은 현재 사용할 수 있는 정보와 행동을 보여줍니다.
  - key: onboarding.permissions
    language: en
    text: Good. The permissions list shows the information and actions currently available to you.
  - key: onboarding.allocate
    language: ko
    text: '이번에는 빈 치환문을 등록하겠습니다.

      입력: {command}

      이번 연습에 사용할 이름은 {slot}입니다.'
  - key: onboarding.allocate
    language: en
    text: Let's register an empty substitution. Enter {command}. We will use the name {slot} for this exercise.
  - key: onboarding.reference
    language: ko
    text: '다음 명령으로 {slot}에 지휘소를 연결하십시오. 등호 오른쪽에 치환할 대상을 적습니다.

      {command}'
  - key: onboarding.reference
    language: en
    text: Enter {command} to bind {slot} to headquarters. Write the target on the right of the equals sign.
  - key: onboarding.substitution
    language: ko
    text: 이제 지휘소를 가리키는 이름은 {slot}입니다.
  - key: onboarding.substitution
    language: en
    text: Now you can use {slot} to refer to headquarters.
  - key: onboarding.dot
    language: ko
    text: 대상 뒤에 마침표를 입력하면 권한 목록이 나옵니다. Tab이나 Enter로 후보를 확정하십시오. 후보 이름을 쓰기 시작하면 Space로도 확정할 수 있습니다. 다음 Enter로 명령을 보냅니다.
  - key: onboarding.dot
    language: en
    text: Type a dot after a target to see its permissions. Accept a suggestion with Tab or Enter. Space also accepts after you start typing its name. Press Enter again to send the command.
  - key: onboarding.invoke
    language: ko
    text: '연결 상태를 확인하겠습니다. 다음 명령을 입력하십시오:

      {command}'
  - key: onboarding.invoke
    language: en
    text: Let's check the connection. Enter {command}.
  - key: onboarding.release
    language: ko
    text: '통신 확인. 마지막으로 다음 명령으로 연습용 치환문을 폐기하겠습니다:

      {command}'
  - key: onboarding.release
    language: en
    text: Connection confirmed. Finally, discard the exercise substitution by entering {command}.
  - key: onboarding.world
    language: ko
    text: 치환문을 폐기해도 실제 지휘소는 사라지지 않습니다. 대상을 부르는 규칙만 정리한 것입니다.
  - key: onboarding.world
    language: en
    text: Discarding a substitution does not remove headquarters. You have only removed a rule for referring to it.
  - key: onboarding.coffee
    language: ko
    text: 지휘소의 권한 목록에서 커피 요청도 찾아보십시오. 명령은 화면 밖의 실제 행동으로 이어집니다.
  - key: onboarding.coffee
    language: en
    text: You can also find a coffee request in headquarters' permissions. Commands lead to real actions beyond the screen.
  - key: onboarding.finish
    language: ko
    text: 기본 연결 확인을 마쳤습니다. 남은 임무 안내와 수락 여부는 메일에서 확인하십시오. 이제 귀하의 명령을 기다리겠습니다.
  - key: onboarding.finish
    language: en
    text: Basic checks are complete. Review the assignment and its acceptance in Mail. We will now await your commands.
  - key: onboarding.detour1
    language: ko
    text: '그 명령도 유효합니다만, 지금은 다음 명령을 확인하는 중입니다:

      {command}

      계속해 볼까요?'
  - key: onboarding.detour1
    language: en
    text: That command is valid, but we're checking {command} right now. Shall we continue?
  - key: onboarding.detour2
    language: ko
    text: 호기심은 좋습니다. 순서만 지켜 주십시오. 지금 요청한 명령은 {command}입니다.
  - key: onboarding.detour2
    language: en
    text: Curiosity is useful. Please follow the sequence. The requested command is {command}.
  - key: onboarding.angry1
    language: ko
    text: 'Kernel. 지금은 장난칠 때가 아닙니다.

      {command}

      지시를 이행하십시오.'
  - key: onboarding.angry1
    language: en
    text: 'Kernel. This is not the time for games.

      {command}

      Follow the instruction.'
  - key: onboarding.angry2
    language: ko
    text: '같은 설명을 반복하게 하지 마십시오.

      {command}

      듣고 계십니까, Kernel?'
  - key: onboarding.angry2
    language: en
    text: 'Do not make me repeat myself.

      {command}

      Are you listening, Kernel?'
